const e={contract:{wuerbayejinchang:"MLM",xianggangtouzizhe:"Third-party guarantee company"},home:{quanqiuzhanlueejinshulinhangzhe:"Global Leader in Strategic Metals",wuerbayelianchangjianjie:"Established in 1949, the MLM Metallurgical Plant successfully transformed from military nuclear material production to the peaceful energy sector. With over seventy years of expertise in nuclear fuel and rare metals, it has developed an integrated industrial chain covering exploration, smelting, processing, and research. Under strict supervision of the IAEA, it supplies key materials to the global nuclear, aerospace, and new energy industries. Its secure and stable supply network has established its world-class position in strategic metals.",hexinshili:"Core Strength",hexinshilimiaoshu:"MLM possesses a complete industrial chain from exploration, mining, and smelting to research and trading, maintaining global leadership in rare metals and nuclear fuel.",xiyoujinshu:"Rare Metals",heranliao:"Nuclear Fuel",quanchanyelian:"Full Chain",duoyuanjishu:"Multi-Tech",xiyoujinshumiaoshu:"MLM is a full-chain barium supplier in the Eurasian region, mastering unique purification technology to produce reactor-grade high-purity barium. With abundant raw material reserves and comprehensive processing capabilities for tantalum and niobium, the company also leads in hydrofluoric acid and precision tools, serving high-end industries such as new energy, semiconductors, and aerospace.",heranliaomiaoshu:"With over 70 years of nuclear fuel manufacturing experience, MLM is a key supplier for nuclear power plants worldwide. Its fuel pellets are used in nearly half of the world’s reactors, maintaining an excellent safety record. With internationally certified systems and advanced processes, the company achieves the highest global manufacturing standards, continuing to lead the nuclear energy industry.",quanchanyelianmiaoshu:"MLM has achieved a full-chain operation from resource exploration to product trading and settlement. This vertical integration ensures supply chain stability, reduces costs, and strengthens resistance to market fluctuations. Supported by comprehensive quality control, logistics, and financial systems, the company responds quickly to clients while maintaining long-term competitiveness and profitability.",duoyuanjishumiaoshu:"The company actively develops automated metallurgy, environmental recycling, and digital platforms, leveraging AI and big data for intelligent production to enhance capacity and efficiency. With multiple international patents in nuclear materials, green metallurgy, and waste recycling, it remains a leader in sustainable innovation, providing forward-looking solutions for the global energy transition.",lishiyuzhuanxing:"History and Transformation",lishiyuzhuanxingmiaoshu:"Established in 1949, MLM went through eras of Cold War military industry, Kazakhstan’s independence, and international supervision. In 1997, it was integrated into Kazatomprom, completing a strategic transformation from military core production to peaceful utilization.",lengzhanjungongjidi:"Cold War Military Base",lengzhanjungongjidimiaoshu:"The company originated as a core smelting facility (code “A2”) in the Soviet nuclear weapons program, producing high-enriched uranium fuel for submarines and satellites. The advanced technology and quality systems established during this period laid a solid foundation for its later transformation into an international supplier of peaceful nuclear energy.",hasakedulie:"Kazakhstan’s Independence",hasakeduliemiaoshu:"After Kazakhstan’s independence, MLM came under the supervision of the IAEA, marking a fundamental shift from military use to peaceful applications. By introducing international monitoring systems, the company improved the transparency and safety of nuclear fuel management and began international cooperation, gradually building global credibility.",iaeajianguanhepingheneng:"IAEA Supervision → Peaceful Nuclear Energy",iaeajianguanhepinghenengmiaoshu:"Under IAEA supervision, MLM implemented digitalization and automation to upgrade its nuclear material accounting and safety monitoring systems. This improved its precision to international top standards, earning certifications from countries such as Japan and the United States, and establishing a strong foundation for becoming a global core supplier.",bingrukazatomprom:"Integration into Kazatomprom",bingrukazatomprommiaoshu:"The integration into Kazatomprom marked MLM’s complete transformation toward marketization and globalization. This not only solidified its position in the global nuclear fuel supply chain but also elevated its business to a national strategic level, turning the former military smelter into a global leader in strategic metals and nuclear materials.",quanqiuhezuozijinwangluo:"Global Cooperation & Capital Network",zijinmiji:"Capital Intensive",zijinmijimiaoshu:"Early-stage exploration and equipment commissioning for a single mine requires hundreds of millions of USD.",guojihezuoanli:"International Cooperation Cases",guojihezuoanli1:"Partnered with China General Nuclear Power Group, investing USD 133 million to acquire a 49% stake in two uranium mines.",guojihezuoanli2:"Led the IAEA Global “Low-Enriched Uranium Bank” project with a USD 150 million investment, supported by Japan, the U.S., and Sweden through funding and technology.",zhengfuzhichi:"Government Support",zhengfuzhichimiaoshu:"Kazakhstan provides tax incentives and relaxed foreign ownership restrictions to attract global investment.",weilaishichangyuzhanluejiyu:"Future Markets and Strategic Opportunities",weilaishichangyuzhanluejiyumiaoshu:"In the face of strong demand for nuclear fuel and rare metals, MLM’s 25-year reserves and full industrial chain offer significant advantages. The company will continue expanding in nuclear energy, new energy, and aerospace, aiming to become a key force shaping the global strategic metal supply landscape.",weilaitouzidejinshu:"The Metallic Power of Future Investment",niegulidengzhanlue:"Nickel, Cobalt, Lithium, and other strategic metals — one-stop global trading",xiyoujinshuxiquejihui:"Rare Metals, Rare Opportunities",hangtaijijinshu:"Aerospace-grade metals and semiconductor materials — aligned with global markets",zhanluekuangchan:"Strategic Minerals\\nDefine the Future of Industry",gensuiguojiqushi:"Follow Global Trends, Seize the Key Supply Chain"}};export{e as default};
